Machine learning has enabled us to ask the same questions in different ways. In this work I use it to explore questions and art histories.

Using tools like RunwayML and TensorFlow.js, I chose artists known to be expressionists but from a different geography (like Souza) and others for their distinct style (Picasso, Van Gogh). I even tried specific paintings, like Guernica, to see how they would turn out. Including the theoretical and contextual aspects remains a challenging, open question.
